  "notes": "Source table provides termination rates by Years of Service only, with separate columns for Males and Females. Rates are printed as percentages. Target requires a single rate per service bin; since no headcount distribution by gender is provided for weighting, a simple mean of the Male and Female columns is used (series_op: mean). The rate is broadcast across all target ages (broadcast axis: age) as the source does not vary by age. Target service bins 1, 2, 3, 4, 6, 8, 10, 11, 12, 30, 40 map directly to the printed service intervals (e.g., '0 to 1' maps to target 1). Target bins 5, 7, 9, 13-29, 31-39 are not explicitly requested in the target grid.",
